h=200&s=98beb4f2e307a37b489f1f3a35a4007e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0f9b9358/uploads/origins/77e7b0bd-5872-48fe-9014-b3bd88c32d8a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4743b796d20326966676a3e7b501c91d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello teacher!\nCan I request my OC?\n\n[CP] Ichiro (攻め) x Alex (受け)\nAlex (185 cm): He is a young emperor of a kingdom. He has tan skin and a gold-colored eyes. He has burn scars on one side of his body. To strangers, he seems cruel and threatening despite having a soft, selfless heart. His key motifs are gold, fire, and the sun.\n\nIchiro (185 cm): He has dark blue hair and sea-colored eyes. His smile is kind and his personality is warm. Despite his gentle appearance, he has a dark side to his personality. He is an assassin who works in secret for the emperor. His key motifs are sea, sky, and the moon.\n\nAlex and Ichiro are childhood friends who grew up in the slums together. Ichiro is Alex’s trusted companion and the only person opens up to. Asa teases Alex a lot, but is very protective of him.\n\nI would like to request a romantic illustration. I will leave the composition and pose to you, but please make them interact if possible!\n\nThank you for the consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/17yFTaERams_KJGxf45L7RyH4zJirRB9d", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@POMIDAX/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9b023515/uploads/origins/b012c760-764a-4d46-87c4-0f37d3984b1c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4f6657caa490e6ac8793f3f77f86df5a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9b023515/uploads/origins/b012c760-764a-4d46-87c4-0f37d3984b1c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4f6657ca